==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract/TotK|Electric Keese}}
Electric Keese in {{TotK}} are identical those in {{BotW}}. They can be found most commonly in the [[Gerudo Desert]], with [[Gloom-Wreathed Enemy|Gloom-Wreathed]] variants also appearing throughout the [[Depths]]. Electric Keese attack similarly to regular [[Keese]], but they also have the ability to shock [[Link]]. Such attacks will stun him momentarily and cause him to drop metallic [[Weapon]]s, [[Bow]]s, and [[Shield]]s he has equipped. Each strike from an Electric Keese deals two [[Heart]]s of damage to Link.

Upon defeat, Electric Keese may drop [[Electric Keese Eyeball]]s and [[Electric Keese Wing]]s.

