{{Noncanon|Start}}
Electric Keese appear as [[Enemy|Enemies]] in {{AoC}}. They often drop [[Electric Keese Wing]]s or [[Keese Eyeball]]s upon defeat. Killing one also rewards the [[Warrior]]s with a [[Keese Trophy]] at the end of a [[Challenge]] or [[Scenario]].

Electric Keese can often be found in Challenges or Scenarios that are electric-themed or take place in the [[Yiga Clan Hideout]].
{{Noncanon|End}}

